      <description><![CDATA[<p>ThorReborn now updates itself.</p><ul><li>Check for Updates works, from the menu bar or Settings, signed with Sparkle.</li><li>New &quot;Automatically check for updates&quot; setting.</li><li>App icons for symlinked apps (like Safari) no longer show an alias arrow.</li></ul><p>Coming from 1.0.0? That version can&#x27;t update itself, so download this one by hand, quit ThorReborn, and replace the app in Applications. Future updates install from inside the app.</p>]]></description>
